{
 "info": {
  "_postman_id": "or-validate-without-saving-2026-11-25",
  "name": "OpenRegister Validate Without Saving",
  "description": "POST /api/objects/{register}/{schema}/validate against the save it predicts (change records-validate-without-saving, task 3.1).\n\nWHAT IT ASSERTS: a sample whose coded value is not a concept of its scheme is answered 200 with valid false and an error on that property by the `coded-value` rule; the validate writes no object; a concept of the scheme is valid (CONTROL); saving the invalid sample answers 422 naming the same property with the same message validate gave.\n\nHermetic: it creates its concept scheme, concept, schema and register, and removes all of them.",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
